# File: scripts/__tests__/sdlc-deliver.test.mjs
# Generated from: specs/448-require-observed-closing-issue-linkage-before-exact-head-merge/requirements.md
Feature: Require observed closing-issue linkage before exact-head merge

  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: Missing linkage blocks the exact-head merge
    Given issue #42 has merge-ready pull request #77 whose body contains "Closes #42"
    And GitHub reports closing references for #77 that do not include issue #42 at "https://github.test/owner/repo/issues/42"
    When ordinary delivery runs for #42
    Then no merge command is issued
    And the deliver handoff fails with reason "closing_linkage_unobserved" and summary "PR #77 does not link issue #42; exact-head merge not attempted"
    And pull request #77 remains open and branch "feature/42-delivery" remains on the local and remote repository

  @SCN002 @regression
  Scenario: Observed linkage allows the exact-head merge
    Given issue #42 has merge-ready pull request #77
    And GitHub reports a closing reference for #77 with number 42 and URL "https://github.test/owner/repo/issues/42"
    When ordinary delivery runs for #42
    Then closing references are read before the merge command
    And pull request #77 is merged at the exact head and issue #42 is CLOSED
    And the deliver handoff passes

  @SCN003 @regression
  Scenario: Deliver worker waits and diagnoses without a fixed limit
    Given ordinary delivery reported "closing_linkage_unobserved" for #42
    When the deliver worker prompt for #42 is rendered from the open-pr workflow
    Then it directs the worker to wait for CI and other pull request checks and processes, re-observe live closing linkage, diagnose repository-specific causes, and rerun ordinary delivery with no numeric observation limit
    And it forbids merging outside ordinary delivery, force-pushing, and synthesizing a handoff
    And it directs the worker to keep the branch and pull request and report the exact gap when linkage cannot be established

  @SCN004 @regression
  Scenario: Post-merge reconciliation is preserved
    Given pull request #77 is already MERGED at the exact head
    And GitHub reports no closing reference to issue #42
    When ordinary delivery reconciles #42
    Then no new merge command is issued
    And the deliver handoff fails with reason "delivery_linkage_unproven" and summary "Merged PR #77 does not link issue #42"
